    {"id":"PrivacyTitle","text":"Privacy and data"},
    {"id":"PrivacyParagraph1","text":"The game keeps your progress, your wallet (including the coins you bought), your settings and the records of your attempts on this phone. A copy of your progress and wallet is also kept in your cloud save."},
    {"id":"PrivacyParagraph2","text":"Purchases are made by Google Play or the App Store; your card and payment details never reach the game. There is no ad network."},
    {"id":"PrivacyParagraph3","text":"The records hold neither your name nor anything about your phone, only a random ID given to this phone. The game never sends this ID anywhere."},
    {"id":"PrivacyParagraph4","text":"If your phone’s backup is on, Android may add these files to its own backup."},
    {"id":"PrivacyParagraphUnity","text":"The game’s purchase library is Unity’s. On every purchase attempt, Unity receives the product, the price, the store’s receipt, your phone’s model and language, and on iPhone and iPad the app identifier Apple gives your device. Unity uses them for its financial records, its legal obligations and to prevent fraud. This cannot be turned off."},
    {"id":"PrivacyParagraphStatistics","text":"If you allow it, the game sends Aptabase, an analytics service, short notes on how it is played: the game opening, the level you play, whether you won and how many moves were left, the painting and room you completed, the shop opening and what you bought there (without payment details). Each note holds its time and a random number for that session only, with the game’s version and your phone’s operating system and language. Aptabase counts them in the European Union; from your connection’s IP address it works out your approximate location (country and region), and it does not store your IP address."},
    {"id":"PrivacyParagraphStatisticsChoice","text":"The notes hold no name, e-mail address, advertising ID or ID that recognises your phone. If you say no, the game works just the same. You can change your choice at any time with the Game statistics switch in Settings."},
    {"id":"PrivacyParagraphNoServer","text":"If you uninstall the game or change phones, your progress and coins come back from your cloud save; if you are not linked to Google Play Games or Game Center, this works only on the same phone or with your phone’s backup. With Delete my data in Settings you can delete your account and save in the cloud at any time; you choose whether to delete the progress on the phone too. To prevent fraud, an anonymous trace of your purchases is kept for 36 months. Refunds are asked for from Google Play or Apple."},
    {"id":"PrivacyDeleteTheRecords","text":"Delete records"},
