    {"id":"PrivacyFileLine","text":"{file} · one line per finished attempt"},
    {"id":"PrivacyPageOf","text":"{page} / {pages}"},
    {"id":"ConsentQuestion","text":"May we count how the game is played, to make it better?"},
    {"id":"ConsentParagraph1","text":"If you allow it, the game sends short notes on the levels you play, how they end, the paintings you complete and what you buy in the shop (without payment details). Aptabase, an analytics service, counts them in the European Union and works out your approximate location (country and region) from your connection."},
    {"id":"ConsentParagraph2","text":"No name, e-mail address, advertising ID or ID that recognises your phone is sent. The notes are never used for ads and never shared."},
    {"id":"ConsentParagraph3","text":"If you say no, the game works just the same, and so do purchases. You can change your choice in Settings at any time."},
